    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/351351/Spheres-Apocrypha-Monster-Traditions?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Banners</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Banner class feature, character level 10th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The time required to wave a banner is reduced by one step (i.e., full-round action becomes a standard action, standard action becomes a move action).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
